            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"text_format\":\"html,markdown,preview\",\"react\":true,\"auto_resync\":false,\"lyrics\":{\"body\":{\"html\":\"[Intro]\\nWait, haha, waith\\nWetin you think though? (<i>OctobersRich, you are so gu—</i>)\\nWetin you dey talk 'bout?\\nMtchew, mtchew, eh-eh, we— we— (Fuck)\\nWhich kin' things wey you dey talk 'bout? (Fah)\\nWetin you think though? (Fah)\\n\\n[Chorus]\\nYou talk say you be blood, you talk say you be my bro\\nWhere you been dey when I dey on— ah, on a low?\\nI don see some kind things for my eyes, anya m o\\nThe only person wey dey with me na my bro\\nNa my Nnamdi Azikiwe, Iwe\\nNnamdi Azikiwe, Iwe\\nNnamdi Azikiwe, Iwe\\nThe only person wey dey with me na my bro\\n\\n[Verse]\\nWait, wetin you dey talk 'bout? (Wait)\\nWetin you dey think though? (Wait)\\nWetin you dey reason for your mind?\\nNnamdi Azikiwe, that's my guy\\nPlay with my Nnamdi Azikiwe, you go die\\nNnamdi Azikiwe, enter the environment like a fi— fuck (Fah)\\nNnamdi Azikiwe enter the environment, and he pursue Queen Elizabeth\\nNnamdi pursue Frederick Lord Lugard\\nAll of them òyìnbó, them been dey lose guard\\nTouch Nnamdi, wallahi, you go turn to yam\\nNnamdi, okwu m na-ekwu, yo, twah\\nNnamdi, introduce me to Benjamin Franklin\\nEvery second, a couple Nnamdis dey use something\\n<a href=\\\"/42210952\\\" data-id=\\\"42210952\\\" class=\\\"null\\\" data-editorial-state=\\\"accepted\\\">Wetin be the something?\\nOga, it's nothing</a>\\n\\n[Chorus]\\nYou talk say you be blood, you talk say you be my bro (Wait)\\nWhere you been dey when I dey on— ah, on a low? (Wetin you dey talk 'bout?)\\nI don see some kind things for my eyes, anya m o\\nThe only person wey dey with me na my bro\\nNa my Nnamdi Azikiwe, Iwe\\nNnamdi Azikiwe, Iwe\\nNnamdi Azikiwe, Iwe\\nThe only person wey dey with me na my bro\"}},\"client_timestamps\":{\"updated_by_human_at\":1793929860,\"lyrics_updated_at\":1793929860}}"
          }
        },
